--- !u!1001 &7885362244115738037
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1768763694}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.size
      value: 16
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].text
      value: "You're awake. The ship woke us up from cryosleep.\n\nThere's a planet
        on the radar that might be worth researching. \n\nIt shouldn't be inhabited,
        yet it's covered in structures.\n\nUse the telescope to get a proper look
        before we commit to a landing."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[1].text
      value: 'We''re down, and the atmosphere checks out just like the readings predicted
        - you can breathe freely out here, no helmet needed.


        My sensors
        are picking up a structure to the north - looks like a temple entrance. That''s
        our best lead.


        Take your time if you want - there''s plants and
        a structures nearby worth a look before we head in.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[2].text
      value: 'There''s a sealed door up ahead, and my scans tell there''s another
        chamber behind this wall.


        Look around, maybe we can find a way
        to get back there.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[3].text
      value: 'We''re back aboard. Go set the tablet down by the artifact analyzer.
        A piece of whoever built that temple, right here on our ship.


        I
        want to date the stone and decode those patterns, but the ArtifactAnalyzer
        keeps returning garbage. It has been off ever since we entered orbit.


        Don''t
        forget to check the machines console and software. As it has never seen anything
        like this, it might malfunction.


        Once it runs clean, it will take
        some time until we can read what the builders left for us.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[4].text
      value: 'The ArtifactAnalyzer is running, great job! The translation will take
        a while.


        Meanwhile the radar picked up a second structure on the
        planet, not far from the first temple. Same builders, by the look of it.


        Maybe
        we find out there where they all went. The teleporter is locked onto the
        new site. Ready when you are!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].text
      value: 'We''re down. This region looks rougher than the first landing site,
        but the architecture matches.


        Take a look around. Whoever built
        these was more advanced than we first thought.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[6].text
      value: 'The seedling is aboard now, let''s seal it safely into its stasis case.
        A living plant, after all this time under the builders'' care.


        But
        something this fragile needs steady air circulation to survive outside stasis,
        and the VentControl has been acting up ever since we landed.


        Go
        take a look at the VentControl software. Once the air holds stable, we can
        keep the seedling aboard and study it properly.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[7].text
      value: 'The seedling is doing fine, the air values are stable. Well done!


        And
        the translation of the tablet has finished:


        The builders'' planet
        was dying. They tried to save it by modifying their plants to survive the
        changing climate.


        But the record ends abruptly. Not a word about
        whether it worked. And still no trace of the builders themselves.


        The
        radar shows a third structure. Maybe the answer lies there. To the teleporter!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[8].text
      value: 'The readings here are strange. This temple was built on a remote island.


        Let''s
        head north to the entrance and find out why.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[9].text
      value: 'The sample of that agent is aboard now, sealed in a flask. This is
        the very substance the builders used on their plants.


        I am still
        reading traces of it in the seedling''s cells. Potent stuff, and it must
        not leak anywhere inside the ship.


        We should try applying it to
        our sample, but the dosage keeps glitching. Go fix it, so we can study it''s
        effects.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[10].text
      value: 'The chamber is working as intended again.


        I cross-checked
        the seedling and the tablet, and something doesn''t add up. The agent changes
        far more than just plants.


        There is one last structure on the radar,
        larger than all the others. I have a feeling we''ll find an answer there.


        The
        teleporter is ready. Let''s finish this!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].text
      value: 'We''re down. This place is enormous...


        No plants at all around
        here. Just dust and silent walls.


        Whatever happened on this planet,
        I think it ended here. Let''s find the entrance.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[12].text
      value: 'This chamber was full of records. Give me a moment...


        Oh
        no.


        The agent worked. The plants survived the dying climate and
        made it lifeable again. But it did not stop with the plants.


        It
        spread to the builders themselves. Their bodies changed, and generation by
        generation they faded away. The experiments that saved their world made THEM
        disappear.


        We should rather not share their fate.


        Go
        deactivate the Portal, then we can leave this desolate place behind!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[13].text
      value: 'This temple''s insides look far more refined than the first. The builders
        honed their craft here.


        My scans show another sealed chamber behind
        the far wall. There has to be a way to open it, so look around.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[14].text
      value: 'Inside, the readings spike hard. Whatever happend came from in here.


        There''s
        another hidden chamber behind the wall. Find what opens it.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[15].text
      value: 'The largest hall yet, and the walls are covered in markings. The answer
        to the builders'' fate has to be close.


        One last sealed chamber
        waits at the back. Let''s find the way in.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[16].text
      value: "The engine was attacked! \n\nBut luckily your tests detected it soon
        enough and powered it off.\n\nNow try to fix the engine software as soon
        as possible, so we can turn it back on and continue our journey."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[17].text
      value: 'The automatic harvesting system was attacked.


        But luckily
        your tests detected it soon enough and powered it off.


        Try to fix
        the software, so the food production can continue as usual.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[18].text
      value: 'Oh, looks like the smart fridge was attacked.


        But luckily
        your tests detected it soon enough and powered it off.


        Try to fix
        the software before the food inside gets warm.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[19].text
      value: 'It seems like something is wrong with the reactor.


        Nice job
        with the tests! They detected it before the reactor software crashed.


        Something
        with the temperatures was the problem, so the cooling system is now turned
        off.


        Try to fix the software as soon as possible, so that we can
        activate the cooling system of the reactor again!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[20].text
      value: "The RNA analyzer was attacked! \n\nBut luckily your tests detected
        it soon enough and powered it off.\n\nNow try to fix its software as soon
        as possible, so we can turn it back on."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[21].text
      value: 'Well done!


        The engines are up and running again.


        Let''s
        continue our walk through the ship.


        While the door back opens and
        closes automatically, the next one seems to be broken again.


        Can
        you fix it?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[22].text
      value: 'Good job!


        You don''t need to worry about food anymore now.


        I
        don''t need to worry about food at all though, that''s even better.


        Come
        on now, let''s use the food and get you something to eat!


        Ah, but
        the door is broken again. Of course it is.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[23].text
      value: 'Awesome!


        Well since you just had a break and ate something,
        I hope you''re ready for some important work again.


        Let''s check
        in on the reactor.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[24].text
      value: 'I''m very happy we managed this without blowing up the ship. Congrats.


        And
        look .. another broken door. At least you know what to do by now.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[25].text
      value: 'Nice!


        We can take a shortcut through the main hall now.


        The
        door to the infirmary seems broken though.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[26].text
      value: 'Nice, your tests are up and running!


        Do you want to know
        more about how the engines work?


        Come and take a look at them,
        I will try to explain it.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[27].text
      value: 'Good job, your tests are up and running!


        If you want, I can
        show you all the plants we grow here.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[28].text
      value: "Great, your tests are up and running!\n\nNow you can finally eat something.
        \n\nYou must be hungry after all those years in the cryogenic sleep."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[29].text
      value: 'Good job, your tests are up and running.


        I can finally recharge
        my batteries now!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[30].text
      value: 'Great, your tests are up and running!


        Take a look at the
        defense radar in action now.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[31].text
      value: 'Great, your tests are up and running!


        I think you were laying
        in bed for long enough those last years.


        But hey, if you want,
        here would be enough free beds.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[32].text
      value: 'Look at the defense radar!


        Something tries to attack us!


        And
        the flee algorithm of our space ship does not seem to work!


        But
        luckily your tests detected it soon enough, so we still have some time to
        fix it until the enemies are close enough to hit us.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080662766609989888, guid: c93142cdf2ccc2647b4509f43dbaf202, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].Condition.mode
      value: 1
